ChinaScore is a travel log for China.

Score each place from 0 to 5. The sum is your total out of 155. Map, notes, and photos stay on this device—no account.

Scoring
• Lived there — 5
• Overnight — 4
• Stopped — 3
• Entered — 2
• Passed through — 1
• Not yet — 0

Three map modes: color, mono, and photo-in-shape. Add season, year, a note, and one photo per place.
